1
00:00:01,681 --> 00:00:10,241
Welcome to the Realm of Elderglen: eighty-eight
causally linked entities across three ages of high
fantasy.

2
00:00:10,543 --> 00:00:19,213
Explore expansive procedural cartography with
tectonic ridges, meandering rivers, and
rain-shadow biomes.

3
00:00:19,515 --> 00:00:27,505
Flip to Parchment mode for hand-drawn mountain
chevrons, woodland clusters, and double coastline
ripples.

4
00:00:27,808 --> 00:00:36,538
Browse forty-nine painterly artworks and fifteen
voiced characters generated via zero-key fal.ai
OAuth.

5
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:47,110
Read generated short stories and D&D 5e campaigns
right inside the viewer, with clickable entity
links.
